{"id":"0c4c30f0f2c6862e","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-hitting-time.md","title":"Hitting Time","display":"df-hitting-time — Hitting Time","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hitting-time","aliases":["58-df-hitting-time","Stopping Time","Hitting Time"],"display":"df-hitting-time — Hitting Time","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[./58-df-function-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hitting-time"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hitting-time</span><span>Stopping Time</span><span>Hitting Time</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hitting-time — Hitting Time"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa82947fba077a45\" href=\"?note=aa82947fba077a45\" title=\"./58-df-function-set.md\">58-df-function-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,B,\\tau_B\\in V\">\\(X,B,\\tau_B\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E^\\Omega\\in V\">\\(E^\\Omega\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aa82947fba077a45\" href=\"?note=aa82947fba077a45\" title=\"./58-df-function-set.md\">58-df-function-set.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HittingTimeOn}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{HittingTimeOn}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HittingTime}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{HittingTime}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hitting\\text{-}time} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HittingTimeOn}_S(\\tau_B,X,B,\\Omega,E) \\leftrightarrow\nB\\subseteq E\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},E^\\Omega)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\tau_B,\\Omega,[0,\\infty])\\land\n\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\\tau_B(\\xi)=\\inf\\{t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}:X(t)(\\xi)\\in B\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hitting\\text{-}time} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HittingTimeOn}_S(\\tau_B,X,B,\\Omega,E) \\leftrightarrow\nB\\subseteq E\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},E^\\Omega)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\tau_B,\\Omega,[0,\\infty])\\land\n\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\\tau_B(\\xi)=\\inf\\{t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}:X(t)(\\xi)\\in B\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hitting\\text{-}time\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HittingTime}_S(\\tau_B,X,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Omega,E\\in V\\;\\mathrm{HittingTimeOn}_S(\\tau_B,X,B,\\Omega,E)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hitting\\text{-}time\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HittingTime}_S(\\tau_B,X,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Omega,E\\in V\\;\\mathrm{HittingTimeOn}_S(\\tau_B,X,B,\\Omega,E)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The process is evaluated as the declared function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X(t)(\\xi)\">\\(X(t)(\\xi)\\)</span>; no undeclared subscripted process <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_t\">\\(X_t\\)</span> is introduced.</li>\n<li>The exact predicate exposes the sample and state spaces. The three-place name is retained only as an existential compatibility projection; the convention <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\inf\\varnothing=\\infty\">\\(\\inf\\varnothing=\\infty\\)</span> is used.</li>\n<li>A hitting time is a stopping time only under appropriate adaptedness and measurability hypotheses; that theorem is not folded into the definition.</li>\n<li>Optional stopping: bounded stopping times preserve martingale property</li>\n<li>Wald's identity: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{E}[M_\\tau] = \\mathbb{E}[M_0]\">\\(\\mathbb{E}[M_\\tau] = \\mathbb{E}[M_0]\\)</span></li>\n<li>Doob's optional stopping: convergence under conditions</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Karatzas and Shreve, Brownian Motion and Stochastic Calculus</li>\n<li>Protter, Stochastic Integration and Differential Equations</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-function-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"aa82947fba077a45","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-function-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-function-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"aa82947fba077a45","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E^\\Omega\\in V$ (see [[./58-df-function-set.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,B,\\tau_B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"E^\\Omega\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HittingTimeOn}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HittingTime}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hitting\\text{-}time} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HittingTimeOn}_S(\\tau_B,X,B,\\Omega,E) \\leftrightarrow\nB\\subseteq E\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(X,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},E^\\Omega)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\tau_B,\\Omega,[0,\\infty])\\land\n\\forall\\xi\\in\\Omega\\;\\tau_B(\\xi)=\\inf\\{t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}:X(t)(\\xi)\\in B\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hitting\\text{-}time\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HittingTime}_S(\\tau_B,X,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\Omega,E\\in V\\;\\mathrm{HittingTimeOn}_S(\\tau_B,X,B,\\Omega,E)","display":true},{"tex":"X(t)(\\xi)","display":false},{"tex":"X_t","display":false},{"tex":"\\inf\\varnothing=\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{E}[M_\\tau] = \\mathbb{E}[M_0]","display":false}],"bytes":1889,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-624","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-hitting-time.md|58-df-hitting-time]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","aa82947fba077a45"]}